  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0143_c53cc76e2d39.png\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 187px;\" /></p><p>Equation of line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></math> perpendicular to <math><mi>L</mi><mi></mi><mo>:</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> is<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math><br /><br />Distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></math> from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3 </mn></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math><br /><br />Line can be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;(since <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math> is in the third quadrant)</p>"
